WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:03,120
Spending two thousand yuan to find Xiao Zhenbei this time is really a big deal.

2
00:00:03,120 --> 00:00:06,000
After Xiao Zhenbei showed up, he had already applied for cards for more than a dozen people.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:07,400
Now there are more than a dozen people coming over

4
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:08,400
There's still a queue behind you

5
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:09,520
About to take off

6
00:00:13,840 --> 00:00:14,840
It's so funny

7
00:00:14,840 --> 00:00:16,560
Come here to show off your defeat with flower boxing

8
00:00:16,560 --> 00:00:22,520
But for laymen, are you Boss Qin? What are you doing? What am I doing? What can I do? Your place is so lively. Let me come over and take a look.

9
00:00:22,520 --> 00:00:25,520
Isn’t it okay for me to just say a few words when I see this brother acting pretentious?

10
00:00:25,520 --> 00:00:26,840
What did you say?

11
00:00:26,840 --> 00:00:29,040
Why are you just showing off and you don’t even look at it?

12
00:00:29,040 --> 00:00:32,160
This is our brother Xiao’s ability. Bah.

13
00:00:32,160 --> 00:00:33,360
That's okay

14
00:00:33,360 --> 00:00:35,600
You are just people who don’t know how to do it.

15
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:36,680
Otherwise this

16
00:00:36,680 --> 00:00:38,200
Compare in front of everyone

17
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:41,900
Let’s see who is the most powerful one. Let’s face off.

18
00:00:41,900 --> 00:00:43,100
Then let’s compare

19
00:00:43,100 --> 00:00:44,820
Are you comparing your marksmanship or other things?

20
00:00:44,820 --> 00:00:45,980
Fighting is not elegant

21
00:00:45,980 --> 00:00:46,940
It's illegal

22
00:00:46,940 --> 00:00:48,180
Aren’t we just a gym?

23
00:00:48,180 --> 00:00:49,420
Let's compare strength like this

24
00:00:49,420 --> 00:00:52,580
You can move your wrist, okay? I have a condition, please tell me.

25
00:00:52,580 --> 00:00:54,820
You just said that I was just showing off. This is wrong.

26
00:00:54,820 --> 00:00:56,740
I'm calling the Xiao family to kill over 10,000 enemies.

27
00:00:56,740 --> 00:00:57,860
Fooled countless people

28
00:00:57,860 --> 00:01:00,180
Even countless people from my Xiao family died for this.

29
00:01:00,180 --> 00:01:01,860
Are you thinking about our Xiao family gun?
